      "message": "File a repository under topics, and let a stranger explore\n\nA repository is now filed under a few words: lowercase letters, digits\nand hyphens, eight at most, set from its settings page or the API and\nrecorded like everything else. Search matches them as it matches the\nname, and the repository's page wears them as chips.\n\nExplore, at /explore, is where a stranger starts, and it needs nobody\nsigned in: every public repository with what it is for, the topics it\nis filed under, what landed in the last seven days, the share of its\ntree a runner has reproduced from the latest measurement, and what is\nopen, the busiest first and filterable by topic. It sits in the sidebar\nfor everyone, since the sidebar stopped listing the forge's public\nrepositories when it became the reader's own. The same list answers at\nGET /api/explore.\n\nTask: t-6f3kxknm897zr3k69hfjfet5bh\nChange-Id: Itopics0134\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
